       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UNSRV9.
      * UNSOLICITED CARD - CHARGE REVERSAL AND COMPENSATION
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BILLED-CHARGES         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-REVERSED               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-COMPENSATION           PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-BILLED-CHARGES
           PERFORM 2000-REVERSE
           DISPLAY 'REVERSED: ' WS-REVERSED
           DISPLAY 'COMP: ' WS-COMPENSATION
           STOP RUN.
       2000-REVERSE.
           MOVE WS-BILLED-CHARGES TO WS-REVERSED
           COMPUTE WS-COMPENSATION = 2 * WS-REVERSED.
